# rfmechanics — Cline Rules

## Skills
Always invoke vs-rag-query before writing any JSON field or C# API call
not already verified in this session.

## Mod type
[x] Code mod (C# + JSON)

## Mod-specific conventions
- ModId: rfmechanics, domain: rfmechanics
- Side: Universal (patches run on both client and server)
- Harmony ID: "rfmechanics"
- Config: rfmechanics.json in ModConfig folder, loaded in Start()
- Soft coupling to raceframework: trait code is a config string, no hard dep
- All tuning values in config, none hardcoded
- Stats.Set is used for multi-source blended engine stat channels (e.g. walkspeed via
  RFTreeProximityBehavior/RFGoblinTunnelBehavior, source strings "treeproximity"/
  "tunneling"). Each is written only on a threshold-gated change (see each behavior's
  *StatWriteThreshold config field), since Stats.Set marks WatchedAttributes "stats"
  dirty on every call and unconditional per-tick writes cause sync stutter. This is a
  deliberate, scoped exception for multi-source blended stats — bespoke on-demand
  postfix math (Dwarf mining/ore curves, climb speed) still must not use Stats.Set.
  (Rested, formerly the main Stats.Set consumer here, was deleted in Phase 0 of the
  Elf attunement work, 2026-08-14 — see HANDOVER.md.)
- Material gate: only apply mining speed bonus to Ore/Stone blocks
- Class guard: treat null characterClass as not-a-dwarf

## Known wiki gaps for this mod
- CharacterSystem.HasTrait (third-party mod API, not in wiki corpus)